## Electronics circuit

 ```
Components used:
1.Soil moisture sensor (SEN1)
 -Measures the amount of water in the soil
2.Water pump (M1)
 -Pumps water from the tank to the plant
3.Arduino UNO (U1)
 -Controls the operation of the system
4.Power supply (BAT1)
 -Provides power to the components
5.Transistor (T1)
 -Acts as a switch to control the water pump
6.Diode (D3)
 -Protects the circuit from back EMF generated by the pump
7.Resistor (R1)
 -Limits the current to the base of the transistor 
```
